        "callout": "Looks clean. Looks professional. But..."
      },
      "narration": "Look at that. Beautiful S-Q-L. Clean formatting, nice aliases, even threw in an ORDER BY for us. If you're new to this, you'd look at that and think, perfect, ship it. And honestly? That's exactly what I did the first time I got something like this back. I ran it. Got my numbers. Sent it to my boss. Done. Except it wasn't done, because this query has a silent, invisible problem hiding in plain sight.",
